      "text": "Today I Learned you can also spread a static method in #PowerShell across multiple lines:\n\n~~~PowerShell\n[Math]::\n   Pi\n~~~\n\nFor your example:\n\n~~~PowerShell\n[Things.MoreThings.Thing[\n    thing\n]]::new(\n    [Things.MoreThings.OtherThing]::\n        Things.MoreThings.Thing.SubThing\n)\n~~~"
    },
